	6656
	TAD LPM23	/CHECK FOR XOFF
	AND P177
	SZA CLA		/BUFFER FULL?
	6661
	JMP LPCALL+3	/WAIT FOR LP FLAG
	JMP I LPCALL
LPM23,	-23
